      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1900-08-10_WidnesExaminer_art0098" n="art0098">
        <head>GREAT REMEDY.</head>
        <p>THE GREAT REMEDY.</p>
        <p>, b 9 77-TT - FOR GOUT. RHEUMATISM ECIATIOA, LUMBAGO. The exlruciating INin is quickly relieved. Sure, Safe an efrective. All Chemists and Stores at Is. lid. and 2s. 9 per box</p>
        <p>Many fields of corn and barley which a few days ago were ready for the Fickle in Cheshire are lying flat on the ground owing to the recent heavy rains, The strong wind ha., cause I the shedding of the ripe grain. This will be lost. If there is no im- provement in the weather the corn will sprout, and there will be much more damage.</p>
        <p>dertyl t4,jV</p>
